<title>USA: Leasing Edge to repurchase 150,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Leasing Edge to repurchase 150,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leasing Edge Corp said Friday it has approved a stock repurchase program of up to 150,000 shares of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the shares will be purchased in the open market. The number of shares currently outstanding was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
